    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The former shipyard on the five‑acre site in North Sea became a landmark in 2003, preserving historic waterfront character.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6,
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.longislandguide.com/visit/north-sea/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "North Sea’s bayfront setting sets it apart from oceanfront Hamptons, fostering boating, fishing, and shellfishing.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        29
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.longislandguide.com/visit/north-sea/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The hamlet lacks a single downtown, with residential streets spread along North Sea Road, Noyack, and other roads.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21,
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.longislandguide.com/visit/north-sea/"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "North Sea sits on the northern side of the South Fork, facing Peconic Bay rather than the Atlantic.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        26
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.longislandguide.com/visit/north-sea/"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The community blends established neighborhoods, waterfront homes, wooded roads, historic sites, preserved land, marinas, and small commercial areas.",
